  <Docs>
    <summary>Class with information of a view useful to evaluate accessibility needs.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Class with information of a view useful to evaluate accessibility needs. Developers can
            refresh the node with the key <c>#EXTRA_DATA_RENDERING_INFO_KEY</c> to fetch the text size
            and unit if it is <c>TextView</c> and the height and the width of layout params from
            <c>ViewGroup</c> or <c>TextView</c>.</para>
      <para>
